/*
  VehicleHeroWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0108 · VehicleHeroWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  VehicleHeroWidget resolves (table "VehicleHeroWidget") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first groups are the exact keys extracted from the web spec
  (features/dashboard/widgets/VehicleHeroWidget.tsx + components/VehicleHero.tsx),
  namespace "dashboard". The web `buildStatCards` used a few hardcoded English
  labels (Odometer / Ideal Range / Charge Rate / Firmware); those are localized
  here so the native surface holds NO English literals. The remaining keys back
  the native-only chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry, loading/empty/error,
  stale/offline banners) and the registry name/description.
*/

